<h3 id="Scenario_2"><a class="anchor" href="#Scenario_2"></a><code>offerItemID</code>-based validation</h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>To validate flight offer details by <code>offerItemID</code>, include a list of IDs in your request under the <code>offerItemIds</code> array:</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlightjs highlight"><code class="language-json hljs" data-lang="json">{
  "offerItemIds": [
    "qwertyuion-1-1"
  ],
  "formOfPayment": {
    "type": "Credit or Debit Card",
    "cardDetails": {
      "code": "MC",
      "binNumber": "545250"
    }
  },
