<div class="paragraph">
<p>A <a href="https://www.postman.com/">Postman</a> collection has been created for Sabre MS Flight APIs to help you quickly become familiar with various use cases.<br>
It&#8217;s available for download <a href="_attachments/postman_collection.json" class="xref attachment">here</a>.</p>
